{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"The formula for the derivative of $\\arccos(x)$ is:\n\n$\\dfrac{d}{dx}[\\arccos(x)]=\\dfrac{-1}{\\sqrt{1-x^2}}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"Now let's find $\\dfrac{dy}{dx}$:\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\\dfrac{dy}{dx}\u0026=\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\left[\\arccos\\left(-\\dfrac{x}{3}\\right)\\right]\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\dfrac{-1}{\\sqrt{1-\\left(-\\dfrac{x}{3}\\right)^2}}\\cdot\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\left[-\\dfrac{x}{3}\\right]\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\dfrac{1}{3\\sqrt{1-\\dfrac{x^2}{9}}}\n\\end{align}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"In conclusion, $\\dfrac{dy}{dx}=\\dfrac{1}{3\\sqrt{1-\\dfrac{x^2}{9}}}$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"$y=\\arccos\\!\\left(-\\dfrac{x}{3}\\right)$\n\n$\\dfrac{dy}{dx}=?$\n\n[[☃ radio 1]]","images":{},"widgets":{"radio 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"choices":[{"content":"$\\dfrac{1}{3\\sqrt{1-\\dfrac{x^2}{9}}}$","correct":true},{"content":"$\\dfrac{-1}{3\\sqrt{1-\\dfrac{x^2}{9}}}$","correct":false},{"content":"$\\dfrac{1}{3\\left({1-\\dfrac{x^2}{9}}\\right)}$","correct":false,"isNoneOfTheAbove":false},{"content":"$\\dfrac{-1}{3\\left({1-\\dfrac{x^2}{9}}\\right)}$","correct":false,"isNoneOfTheAbove":false}],"deselectEnabled":false,"displayCount":null,"hasNoneOfTheAbove":false,"multipleSelect":false,"randomize":false},"static":false,"type":"radio","version":{"major":1,"minor":0}}}}}
